katten (0.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Version 0.5.0: full rebuild as a Qt-native Kirigami application for
    KDE Plasma 6.
  * Multi-turn conversations via the Mistral Conversations API, stored
    locally with owner-only permissions.
  * Built-in Markdown renderer with tables, lists, links and SVG charts;
    no third-party libraries beyond Qt 6 / KF 6.
  * API key stored in KWallet (folder "Katten"), never in plain text.
  * KRunner integration moved to a separate C++ plugin package
    (katten-krunner) that talks to the app over D-Bus.
  * British English and Danish translations.
  * AppStream metainfo and desktop file for KDE Discover integration.

 -- Emilio González Longoria <hej@emilio.dk>  Fri, 27 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100
